# Code owners for okfmem.
#
# Every PR that touches a matched path auto-requests a review from the owner,
# and (with branch protection's "require review from Code Owners") needs an
# owner's approval to merge. One owner today; add lines as co-maintainers join.
#
# Only the paths that run on a user's machine outside the engine's own logic,
# steer an agent, or change how this repo is guarded are owned. Everything else
# (engine modules, tests, docs) merges on one approving review, which gaal's
# separate reviewer can give.
#
# Syntax: <path pattern>  <@owner ...>   (last matching line wins)

# Repo guards: CI, branch policy, gaal's profile and skills.
/.github/ @s-annam
/.gaal/ @s-annam

# Agent instructions and harness config: what an agent working here reads and runs.
/AGENTS.md @s-annam
/CLAUDE.md @s-annam
/.claude/ @s-annam

# Shipped into users' sessions: skills, plugins, hooks.
/skills/ @s-annam
/plugins/ @s-annam
/scripts/ @s-annam

# Install, launch and uninstall: run directly on users' machines.
/install.sh @s-annam
/install.ps1 @s-annam
/uninstall.sh @s-annam
/uninstall.ps1 @s-annam
/okfmem @s-annam
/okfmem.cmd @s-annam
/okfmem.ps1 @s-annam
/okfmem-statusline.sh @s-annam
/okfmem-statusline.ps1 @s-annam

# Engine modules that push, pull or delete in a user's store.
/memory_sync.py @s-annam
/memory_pull.py @s-annam
/memory_uninstall.py @s-annam
